{"id":"tridtsat_","lemma":"тридцать","pos":"num","rank":1411,"glosses":["thirty (30)"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/9/9d/Ru-%D1%82%D1%80%D0%B8%D0%B4%D1%86%D0%B0%D1%82%D1%8C.ogg/Ru-%D1%82%D1%80%D0%B8%D0%B4%D1%86%D0%B0%D1%82%D1%8C.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"«Сколько вам лет?» — «Тридцать».","en":"\"How old are you?\" \"I'm thirty years old.\"","words":[null,null,null,null],"phrases":[[0,3,"how old are you?"]]},{"text":"Тому тридцать один.","en":"Tom is thirty-one.","words":[{"g":"that one, those ones","l":"тот"},null,{"g":"one"}]},{"text":"Подожди тридцать минут.","en":"Wait thirty minutes.","words":[{"g":"to wait","l":"подождать"},null,null]},{"text":"Тебе почти тридцать.","en":"You're almost thirty.","words":[{"g":"(to) you","l":"ты"},{"g":"almost, nearly"},null]},{"text":"Я дам тебе тридцать минут.","en":"I'll give you thirty minutes.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to give","l":"дать"},{"g":"(to) you","l":"ты"},null,null]}]}